---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';
---

<Base
  title="Message sent"
  description="Your message reached Imagination Applied. We read everything that arrives and reply to the ones we can genuinely help with."
  path="/contact/thanks/"
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1>That reached us</h1>
    <p class="lede">Thank you. We read everything that arrives.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap page-body">
    <p>
      You will hear back from a person, usually within a few working days. If the answer
      is that we are not the right fit, we will tell you that too, and try to point you
      somewhere more useful.
    </p>
    <p>
      In the meantime, the <a href="/publications/">research</a> is the fastest way to see
      how we think about evidence, and <a href="/how-we-work/">how we work</a> covers the
      method.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/">Back to the start</a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={SITE.linkedin}>Follow on LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
